        "original_id": "029d305f-ff44-5c35-9c00-23076496c2e2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: The Palazzo, Venetian Resort and Casino, Sands Convention Center, Sands Expo, original Sands Hotel\n- Companies: Las Vegas Sands Corporation\n- Concepts: hotel-casino complex, convention centers\n\nFacts:\n- Sands Expo opened in 1990 across the street from the original Sands Hotel.\n- Sands Expo was the second largest convention center in the world when it opened.\n- The Palazzo and casino are part of a larger complex operated as one hotel with the adjoining Venetian Resort and Casino and the Sands Convention Center.\n- Las Vegas Sands Corporation owns and operates The Palazzo complex, the Venetian Resort and Casino, and the Sands Convention Center.",
